      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What is public world ready? I know designers will upload avatar even it has poor / very poor indication. You must decide yourself!\nThe signature 'public world' ready has not really meaning, because it might show when everything is green - but avatar might not look nice in the world! \nYou should judge yourself at advices in performance and make it better or not. I am sure you cannot make more better than what you like. Finetuning is not simple work even you're not experienced designer.",
